  <h2>2. Description of the Services</h2>
  <p>
    Storemate CRM is a business management tool for jewellery businesses, covering inventory,
    customer records, orders, and billing. Storemate Connect is an automation tool that connects
    to your Instagram Business or Creator account (with WhatsApp automation planned for a future
    release) to automate replies to comments, direct messages, and story replies, based on rules
    you configure.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Eligibility and accounts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must be at least 18 years old and authorized to act on behalf of your business to use the Services.</li>
