    <li>You may cancel your subscription at any time; cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period unless otherwise stated in our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the Services for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable law.</li>
    <li>Use Storemate Connect to send spam, unsolicited messages, or content that violates Meta's Platform Policies.</li>
    <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or gain unauthorized access to the Services.</li>
    <li>Upload or transmit data you do not have the right to share, including customer data collected without proper consent.</li>
    <li>Interfere with the normal operation of the Services or attempt to disrupt other users' access.</li>
  </ul>

